WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.150
A letter is a number you haven't chosen yet. The same laws work.

2
00:00:05.126 --> 00:00:08.176
A squared times a: three a's, so a cubed.

3
00:00:11.023 --> 00:00:13.998
Two and two: four a's. The indices add.

4
00:00:16.745 --> 00:00:18.495
Two and three make five.
